WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.728 --> 00:00:19.260
Everyone drove along the road.

2
00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:21.766
"Hmm," Eddy thought.

3
00:00:21.766 --> 00:00:34.390
"Who's going to say good-bye?"

4
00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:39.241
"We're here," Ms. Fender said.

5
00:00:39.242 --> 00:00:47.805
"The Tire Town Spaceport.

6
00:00:47.805 --> 00:01:04.983
Please follow the rules."

7
00:01:04.983 --> 00:01:16.705
Everyone gasped.

8
00:01:16.705 --> 00:01:20.974
"I see a rocket!" Jeb said.

9
00:01:20.974 --> 00:01:26.669
"His name is Rocky," Ms. Fender said.

10
00:01:26.669 --> 00:01:30.519
"He's going to space.

11
00:01:30.519 --> 00:01:33.847
We'll watch him blast off!"

12
00:01:33.848 --> 00:01:36.553
"Whoa," Dipper said.

13
00:01:36.553 --> 00:01:43.200
"Space is so cool," Poppy said.

14
00:01:43.201 --> 00:01:46.557
Gasser stared at Rocky.

15
00:01:46.557 --> 00:01:48.685
His eyes were big.

16
00:01:48.685 --> 00:01:53.527
"I never saw a rocket before!"

17
00:01:53.527 --> 00:01:56.228
"Me neither," Eddy said.

18
00:01:56.228 --> 00:01:59.315
"Rockets are so fast!"

19
00:01:59.315 --> 00:02:01.935
"Ms. Fender!" Gasser called.

20
00:02:01.935 --> 00:02:06.360
"Can we meet Rocky?"

21
00:02:06.361 --> 00:02:10.587
"Yes," Ms. Fender said.

22
00:02:10.587 --> 00:02:14.090
"We're going to meet him now."

23
00:02:14.090 --> 00:02:16.743
"Cool," Eddy said.

24
00:02:16.743 --> 00:02:20.309
"I can't wait to meet Rocky."

25
00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:24.840
Zippy laughed.

26
00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:28.266
"You're slow!" he said.

27
00:02:28.266 --> 00:02:34.589
"Rocky won't want to meet you!"
